{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9304.294214,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9701.493685,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9760.797026999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9762.237416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9763.419189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9764.977520999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9766.595443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9768.115334,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":21385.031047,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21854.721053999998,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21903.869142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21905.477914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21907.107766999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21908.77703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21910.434304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21912.080047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21912.964664,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":34093.061743000006,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34415.657475,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34462.895744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34464.257932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34465.872134000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":34467.384044000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34469.064478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":34470.350924000006,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":45124.258396000005,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45602.908764,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45657.777226000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45659.236906000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45660.844858000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45662.445060000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45664.163095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45665.679475000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45667.329178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45669.022892,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45670.638355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45670.798958,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52143.44869500001,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":52408.924869,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":52451.563686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52453.148628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52454.74775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52456.406673000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52457.589607,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":62516.325771,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62780.690193,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62821.730477000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62823.36926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":62825.001493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62825.180176,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62864.480376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62866.004907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62867.612539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":62867.748612,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":77474.704864,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109, ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":78053.226008,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team—Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109—is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":78105.141182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78106.698973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78108.30369500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78109.937858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78111.480249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78113.092531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":78114.696144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":78116.396278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78117.56053100001,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":90745.476788,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":90991.759746,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":91034.21831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":91035.594157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91037.36524300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":91037.50105600001,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":91068.176712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91069.63983100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":91069.789294,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101126.64435,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101450.906875,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101495.80265700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101497.19244500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101498.787737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101500.531802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":101500.629114,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":101533.892963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101535.543386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101537.20787900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101538.448114,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":107843.720608,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":108094.14852,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":108139.171835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108140.533402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":108142.160575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":108144.10529400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":108144.245037,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116360.289434,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116706.618143,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116752.960724,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116754.590547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116756.179969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116757.848952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116759.462465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116759.75091100001,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127078.395127,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127455.589446,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127506.446028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127507.822755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127509.735424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127511.078651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127512.645622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127514.316466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127516.06491100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":127516.162343,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138028.42830899998,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138366.40740999999,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138406.639489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138408.36425299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138409.32361199998,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138448.53793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138450.138993,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138451.786936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138453.49923999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138454.65926299998,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138491.459393,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138492.05015499998,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":151318.157374,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151759.706416,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151815.452846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151818.60587899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":151822.13840999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151826.57152899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":151831.941737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151837.23036299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151842.452208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":151846.732334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":151850.398188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":151850.90935799998,"samples":11088,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":159339.317315,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":159607.609056,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159651.926227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159653.359515,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159654.89711599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159656.55862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159657.717213,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167777.043537,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":168102.43130499998,"text":"He also attacked anything that went into the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":168141.159933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168143.45376899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168144.516491,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":168196.212829,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168197.559366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168199.20723899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":168199.636228,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":179385.12579199998,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179766.616687,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179816.466429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179818.142382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179819.72922399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179821.35291699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179822.900068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179824.541531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179826.353787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179826.65574299998,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":189564.62638099998,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":189874.79378399998,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":189921.456121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189922.815729,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":189924.444631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189925.98752199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189927.49847299999,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":199985.81862799998,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200378.004478,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200421.080184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200422.71508599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200424.285068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200425.935191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200426.76626799998,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200452.48632499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200453.102457,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":213735.665907,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder bekannt."},{"kind":"text","t":214058.323771,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and are known as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":214106.54153999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214107.89279699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214109.476899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214111.05352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214112.67065299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214114.308336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":214114.40408799998,"samples":2592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":224604.901157,"code":1005}]}